--
std::unordered_set<int>::insert, then count() of the inserted and of an
absent element (found dog-fooding src/util/find_symbols.cpp).  The insert
path needed fixes for: deferred members of the _Insert CRTP mixin not
instantiated ([temp.inst]/4); conversion to a private base in a friend of
the derived class ([class.access.base]/4-5,
cpp98_friend_private_base_conversion); the scope of a name declared in an
if condition ([basic.scope.block]/1, cpp98_condition_decl_scope); and
models of _Prime_rehash_policy::_M_next_bkt and _M_need_rehash, which
libstdc++ defines in its compiled library (cpp_typecheck_stdlib.cpp).
